flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> COLLECT[Collect Maintenance Request\n& Malfunction Intake]

    COLLECT --> DIAGNOSE[Diagnose from Manuals\nRAG Vector Store Search]

    DIAGNOSE --> DECOMPOSE[Decompose Maintenance Plan\nTask Decomposition Milestones]

    DECOMPOSE --> ESTIMATE[Estimate Parts & Labor Cost\nCheck $500 Threshold]

    ESTIMATE --> HITL_CHECK{Total Cost > $500?}

    %% ==============================================================
    %% HITL Financial Approval
    %% ==============================================================
    HITL_CHECK -->|No| SCHEDULE[Schedule Technician Visit]
    HITL_CHECK -->|Yes| HITL_PAUSE{{Wait for Manager Sign-off\nHITL_Tasks Interrupt}}

    HITL_PAUSE --> HITL_DECISION{Manager Decision}
    HITL_DECISION -->|Approved| SCHEDULE
    HITL_DECISION -->|Rejected| CLOSE[Close Case]

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Logistics & Execution Waits
    %% ==============================================================
    SCHEDULE --> WAIT_TECH{{Wait for Technician On-Site\nAwaiting Tech Visit Interrupt}}

    WAIT_TECH --> ORDER_PARTS[Order Spare Parts\nInventory Check]

    ORDER_PARTS --> ROUTE_PARTS{Inventory Lookup?}
    ROUTE_PARTS -->|API Error / 504| FAILURE[Handle Failure\nOpen Ticket in Tickets Table]
    ROUTE_PARTS -->|Parts Available| WAIT_DELIVERY{{Wait for Parts Delivery\nAwaiting Delivery Interrupt}}

    WAIT_DELIVERY --> EXECUTE[Execute Maintenance\nSet Equipment Status = maintenance]

    EXECUTE --> WAIT_TEST{{Wait for Operational Testing\nAwaiting Field Test Interrupt}}

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Operational Testing Evaluation & Re-diagnosis
    %% ==============================================================
    WAIT_TEST --> EVALUATE[Evaluate Operational Test]

    EVALUATE --> TEST_OUTCOME{Field Test Result?}
    TEST_OUTCOME -->|Passed| CLOSE
    TEST_OUTCOME -->|Failed| DIAGNOSE
    TEST_OUTCOME -->|Invalid| FAILURE

    %% ==============================================================
    %% Terminal States
    %% ==============================================================
    CLOSE --> END([End])
    FAILURE --> END
